        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] bytes.loose",
          "name": "loose",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "bytes.loose(source, options?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "loose",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.7.0</code></strong></p>\n<p>宽松模式格式化. 宽松模式以 <code>1024</code> 为默认换算基数, 并允许使用更宽松的单位写法.</p>\n",
